      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "The Neil Gehrels Swift Observatory, a space telescope used to study gamma-ray bursts, is re-entering Earth's atmosphere over Sumatra, bringing its mission of nearly 22 years to an end.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-04:5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:11Z",
      "text": "The reports place the re-entry over Sumatra, in Indonesia.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-04:5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:19Z",
      "text": "The report comes from NASA's coverage of the observatory.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-04:5"
      ]
    },
